# Build output, reproducible from source.
**/bin/
**/obj/
out/
artifacts/
.worktrees/

# Editors and OS clutter.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

